    "long_instructions": "## Context\r\n\r\nUse AI Chat to come up with a marketing slogan. \r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. **Copy and paste** the prompt below into AI Chat. Press **Send** and read AI Chat's response. \r\n\r\n>You are a marketing executive at a top footwear brand. Come up with a tagline for a new sports shoes.\r\n\r\n2. Here are some ideas for **context** you can add to your prompt:\r\n    - Who are these shoes designed for?\r\n    - How much will they cost?\r\n    - Where will they be sold?\r\n3. Revise your prompt to AI Chat by adding in **Context**. Press **Send** and read AI Chat's response. \r\n4. Find and complete the section in your Unit Guide called \"Context\". \r\n\r\n**Try it out!**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure what context to add?**]\r\nTry copy and pasting the following revised prompt into AI Chat: \r\n>You are a marketing executive at a top footwear brand. Come up with a tagline for a new sports shoes that is aimed at getting people who don’t consider themselves runners to start running as a hobby.\r\n:::",
